Z||000000||jimmybpei||12-28-2001||06:00 PM||||[These arer a few pic of my winter wheels <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_002_1.jpg"> <P>Skitime can attest to this. This it what happens when i get a day off work and get my crew together.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_032.jpg"> <P>OOPS ther goes the doors and windsheild<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_034.jpg"> <P>There goes the roof.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_035.jpg"> <P>This thing is really falling apart.<P>mg]http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mag_036.jpg[/img]<P>Now shes starting to look a little better.<P>Started this on thursday  at 9:30 am and finished at 5 <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">m. not bad for 6.5 hrs work.<P>Today the fordoors are on and fitted now all thats left is the body work on the 2 back doors and the cab.<P>Later<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jimmybpeisig_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
